  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Rescue Committe kommer att genomf&#xf6;ra ett projekt med syfte att utbilda l&#xe4;rare i m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter mm, f&#xf6;r att de i sin tur skall kunna inkludera det i utbildningen i skolor i Azerbaijan. Projektet &#xe4;r tv&#xe5;&#xe5;rigt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Rescue Committee will implement a programme with the aim to educate teachers in human rights etc. to include the subject into the regular curriculum in schools in Azerbaijan. The programme will be implemented during 2007-2008.</narrative>
  </description>
